---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Battery Carbon Footprint (PCF) & LCA Engine | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Automated Product Carbon Footprint (PCF) engine compliant with EU PEFCR rules and ISO 14040/44 for battery life-cycle assessment."
>
  <div class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-stone-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-emerald-800 uppercase tracking-widest bg-emerald-50 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-200">
          PCF & LCA Automation
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-tight mt-6 mb-6">
          PEFCR-Compliant Battery Carbon Footprint Engine
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          The EU Battery Regulation mandates strict lifecycle carbon accounting across 4 lifecycle stages: Raw Material Acquisition, Battery Manufacturing, Distribution, and Recycling. Our engine automates primary activity data ingestion and calculation with verified emission factor databases.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 Stages Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 sm:gap-8 my-20">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-stone-900">STAGE 1</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Raw Material Extraction</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">Mining and refining emissions for Lithium, Cobalt, Nickel, Manganese, and Aluminum cathode precursors.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-stone-900">STAGE 2</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Battery Manufacturing</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">Dry-room electricity, electrode coating, cell assembly, and formation cycling energy consumption.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-stone-900">STAGE 3</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Distribution & Logistics</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">Maritime shipping, rail freight, and European road transport from gigafactory to OEM port of entry.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-800">STAGE 4</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Recycling & Recovery</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">End-of-life hydrometallurgical recovery credits and recycled content substitution offsets.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="p-12 rounded-3xl bg-stone-900 text-white text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white">Calculate Your Battery Carbon Footprint</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-stone-300 max-w-xl mx-auto font-normal">
          Request a sample carbon declaration report and test your BOM against European PEFCR benchmarks.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-white text-stone-900 font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-stone-100 transition-colors">
          Book PCF Demonstration &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
